    shortDesc: "Custom tissue paper with your logo \u2014 custom print from 500 sheets, stock designs with no minimum order.",
    intro: "Tissue paper is the layer your customer touches first \u2014 the wrap inside the box, printed with your logo in repeat, folded over the product before the lid closes. ELAPACK prints custom tissue to sit inside our rigid boxes, pouches and shopping bags, colour-matched to the rest of your packaging and produced in the same order, so the wrap never arrives as an afterthought from a different supplier.",
